type: dataset
title: "Data Center Atlas"
abstract: >-
  An open dataset of data centres worldwide. Each project has a dated,
  source-backed project status, a sourced location with its precision recorded,
  and source records with URLs, source terms, retrieval dates and scoped content
  hashes. Location precision distinguishes facility locators from town, county,
  region and industrial-estate context points. Data updated 2026-10-26: 667
  physical sites with 709 projects in 63 countries, backed by 3623 evidence
  rows. Three projects (Digital Edge CGK1, Racks Central RCJM1 Phase A and
  Telecom Egypt Regional Data Hub 2) have host-estate context only, not a
  reviewed locator
  (https://kiankyars.github.io/datacenter-atlas/methodology/#locators). Statuses
  are the last reported project status, not the current status; locators are not
  building footprints; reported capacities retain their source scope and
  qualifiers; and the dataset is not a census. Atlas-authored data are licensed
  CC BY 4.0; geometries derived from OpenStreetMap are © OpenStreetMap
  contributors under the ODbL 1.0, and other third-party facts keep their source
  terms (see DATA_LICENSE.md).
